OL,3,GNEWSASWR paid out #8m compensation for
OL,4,Adelayed trains
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Western Railway paid out more
OL,7,Fthan #8m last year in compensation to
OL,8,Fpassengers for delayed or cancelled
OL,9,Ftrains.
OL,11,FThe company became the first failing
OL,12,Ftrain operator taken over and brought
OL,13,Fback into public ownership by the
OL,14,Fgovernment in May 2025.
OL,16,FAccording to the Department for
OL,17,FTransport (DfT), it spent #8.25m on
OL,18,Fpayouts to rail users under its Delay,
OL,19,FRepay scheme.
